WEBVTT

00:15.948 --> 00:18.948
This is the chaotic time of
spontaneous gangs.

00:19.657 --> 00:20.823
In order to scramble for territory...

00:21.612 --> 00:23.236
they are not afraid
to purge each other...

00:23.237 --> 00:24.237
despite the rules.

00:26.571 --> 00:27.071
Butcher...

00:28.529 --> 00:29.029
slaughter...

00:30.862 --> 00:31.946
to survive.

00:33.904 --> 00:35.612
Until the formation of four forces.

00:38.196 --> 00:40.487
These four hold hundreds of juniors
under their command...

00:40.696 --> 00:42.987
creating a balance in the underworld
during the time.

00:45.029 --> 00:46.821
They are known as:

00:47.487 --> 00:47.946
Cuong...

00:49.154 --> 00:50.404
Area: Cho Lon - Weapon: Chopper
Business: Protection, loaning.

00:50.446 --> 00:51.154
Hao...

00:51.179 --> 00:53.987
Area: Float Market - Weapon: Scimitar
Business: Protection, smuggling.

00:54.279 --> 00:54.779
Chan...

00:54.804 --> 00:57.154
Area: Cau Muoi Market - Weapon: Ice saw
Business: Protection, restaurants.

00:57.237 --> 00:57.803
Hung.

00:57.828 --> 00:59.904
Area: Night Market - Weapon: Pig chopper knife
Business: Smuggling, prostitute.

01:00.071 --> 01:03.571
UNTIL ONE DAY...

01:12.071 --> 01:13.112
Hey, who keeps the cigarette pack?

01:13.196 --> 01:13.654
I keep it.

01:13.754 --> 01:15.712
- Give me, I'll give it back to him later.
- Here!

01:15.737 --> 01:16.529
You keep, not me.

01:16.529 --> 01:17.362
- Wait, I didn't keep it.
- You keep...

01:21.347 --> 01:22.164
Attack!

01:29.321 --> 01:30.821
Don't touch my bros.

02:57.571 --> 02:58.029
Gotta leave now!

03:11.362 --> 03:12.279
They're all gone. Stop acting cool.

03:29.071 --> 03:31.320
2 - A SCAR IS A BEAUTIFUL TATTOO

03:31.321 --> 03:32.237
Why did you guys come to this place?

03:35.446 --> 03:35.904
To give this back to you.

03:37.321 --> 03:38.529
We wouldn't dare to "smoke" these things…

03:41.154 --> 03:42.029
You can give me back later!

03:42.571 --> 03:42.904
Hey...

03:43.446 --> 03:44.362
we've just saved you!

03:44.737 --> 03:45.321
Nobody asked you to!

03:46.115 --> 03:47.657
Holy moly!

03:54.690 --> 03:56.099
Hey, Hung!

03:56.998 --> 03:57.985
Let's talk a little bit.

03:58.446 --> 03:59.321
Thank you, fellas.

04:01.362 --> 04:02.112
How is Big Brother?

04:02.446 --> 04:03.092
He's fine.

04:05.041 --> 04:07.014
Why did you hide such cool friends?

04:09.682 --> 04:10.685
Help yourself.

04:13.039 --> 04:15.289
His pals are also my pals.

04:32.601 --> 04:33.278
Thanks.

04:35.232 --> 04:36.475
Wanna follow me to earn some cash?

04:40.368 --> 04:41.217
What job is it?

04:43.265 --> 04:44.256
Join our Cho Lon gang.

04:49.571 --> 04:50.779
Oh…thanks for the offer...

04:52.987 --> 04:56.112
but some dude told me
not to get involved in gangsters.

04:56.987 --> 04:58.529
Now if you'll excuse me,
I've got work to do.

05:00.987 --> 05:02.737
There are three of us.
Next time please offer three cigarettes.

05:10.539 --> 05:12.122
Our gang needs people like them.

05:30.029 --> 05:32.071
How about you stay here
permanently for convenience?

05:32.654 --> 05:34.071
You're battered and scarred every day.

05:35.612 --> 05:36.696
I stopped by yesterday...

05:37.029 --> 05:38.279
but I didn't see you here.

05:39.112 --> 05:41.071
Oh, I was visiting my dad.

05:52.571 --> 05:53.196
Done!

05:55.779 --> 05:58.071
Is your body a place to consign scars?

06:00.029 --> 06:01.071
I didn't want to be like this.

06:02.862 --> 06:03.821
I'm sorry...

06:04.654 --> 06:07.112
for always making you
see those hideous scars.

06:09.529 --> 06:10.737
I'm used to it!

06:11.529 --> 06:12.446
My dad once told me...

06:13.154 --> 06:14.987
for men, a scar is a beautiful tattoo.

06:19.946 --> 06:21.529
Gosh, are you really
thinking of staying here?

07:03.549 --> 07:04.216
Hello ma'am!

07:05.859 --> 07:06.716
Ice delivery!

07:18.362 --> 07:19.904
Alright, here you go.

07:20.029 --> 07:20.709
- Yes.
- Ok!

07:21.466 --> 07:23.966
Ba, park the bike
and then come wash the dishes.

07:24.487 --> 07:25.571
- Yes, ma'am.
- Ok.

07:45.196 --> 07:45.660
Ba!

07:46.200 --> 07:47.479
Remember to wash them thoroughly!

07:48.112 --> 07:48.722
Yes.

07:58.071 --> 07:58.987
Okay, thank you.

07:59.321 --> 08:00.362
I'll deliver tomorrow at the same hour.

08:39.529 --> 08:40.029
Hello?

08:40.657 --> 08:41.163
Ma'am!

08:41.904 --> 08:44.070
Alrigh. I'm in a traffic jam.
I'm coming now.

08:44.071 --> 08:44.616
Okay.

09:30.487 --> 09:31.108
[BLOOD BIOCHEMISTRY ANALVSIS RESULT187]

09:40.281 --> 09:41.656
Long, wait for me!

09:43.321 --> 09:43.889
Yes?

09:45.362 --> 09:46.499
Dad gave you… / No, mom!

09:47.455 --> 09:49.247
Please remember to take care of yourself.

09:52.821 --> 09:53.405
I'm off now.

09:53.615 --> 09:54.592
Okay, get going.

10:26.779 --> 10:29.028
You're too late!
The ice has melted already.

10:29.029 --> 10:30.487
I'll only pay half the price.

10:32.040 --> 10:34.331
I'm sorry, the traffic was heavy.

10:34.612 --> 10:35.452
Ma'am...?

10:39.282 --> 10:42.490
You broke almost all of my dishes!

11:01.112 --> 11:01.862
Damn it!

11:02.298 --> 11:03.522
We only have two packets
of instant noodles left...

11:04.093 --> 11:05.310
and the rat nibbled half a packet.

11:06.196 --> 11:08.279
It's okay. Half a packet
for each of us is still fine.

11:18.705 --> 11:19.945
Long! Come and eat!

11:23.987 --> 11:25.571
Understand for the rat!

11:26.473 --> 11:27.343
C'est la vie!

11:27.924 --> 11:28.799
We're running out of food?

11:29.735 --> 11:30.399
We still have the duck.

11:33.696 --> 11:34.571
Are you insane?

11:36.205 --> 11:36.851
Eat noodles!

11:37.398 --> 11:37.984
Just kidding!

11:39.708 --> 11:40.704
How's your job?

11:41.190 --> 11:41.993
Really good.

11:43.571 --> 11:44.133
How about you?

11:46.174 --> 11:46.836
Same with Ba.

11:49.893 --> 11:50.672
And you?

11:53.154 --> 11:53.904
Same with you two.

12:00.029 --> 12:00.618
Hey!

12:02.674 --> 12:03.633
Should we ask Hung?

12:05.239 --> 12:06.656
He's been here for a long time anyway.

12:07.821 --> 12:08.654
He probably knows
a wide range of occupations.

12:15.821 --> 12:17.029
Damn you, bitch!

12:17.904 --> 12:18.696
Stop right there!

12:19.946 --> 12:22.237
How dare you run away from me?

12:27.946 --> 12:29.237
They are all losers!

12:29.654 --> 12:31.654
Are you cracked? We lost.

12:32.362 --> 12:34.362
You talk too much.
Unlucky is unlucky.

12:34.862 --> 12:35.487
Bullshit!

12:38.279 --> 12:39.154
Come get your fish.

12:40.112 --> 12:40.821
Hurry!

12:42.404 --> 12:44.112
The slowest takes the smallest.

12:47.737 --> 12:48.862
How lucky, it's almost ready.

12:50.237 --> 12:50.988
Hung!

12:51.654 --> 12:52.488
Your arms okay?

12:52.987 --> 12:54.862
Doesn't matter! That's nothing for me.

12:56.862 --> 12:57.654
Yeah, you're right.

12:57.821 --> 12:58.696
Damn it asshole!

12:59.446 --> 13:00.571
Jeez, it doesn't hurt that much.

13:00.987 --> 13:02.903
Hey, to celebrate today's victory...

13:02.904 --> 13:05.862
I will form a guild called
"Four Great Heroes".

13:05.982 --> 13:06.808
I'll be the Master!

13:07.071 --> 13:07.598
I'll bail.

13:08.071 --> 13:09.362
Yo, I'm with Ba.

13:09.529 --> 13:10.362
I'm with them two.

13:10.487 --> 13:11.237
Bastards!

13:12.581 --> 13:12.996
Hey!

13:13.606 --> 13:15.331
I don't regret being born
in this life to meet you guys.

13:15.907 --> 13:16.644
But I do.

13:17.196 --> 13:18.277
Cut the jokes!

13:18.904 --> 13:20.070
Now, let's use these fishes
to replace wine.

13:20.071 --> 13:21.112
The fastest gets the biggest.

13:21.933 --> 13:22.529
I'll get this one.

13:22.529 --> 13:23.237
This one's mine.

13:23.446 --> 13:25.404
- This one's mine.
- This one's mine.

13:26.362 --> 13:27.321
Brothers for life!

13:28.112 --> 13:29.529
- We live and die together!
- We live and die together!

13:31.279 --> 13:33.446
Cheers!

13:35.321 --> 13:36.821
The important thing is,
what do you guys want to do?

13:39.279 --> 13:40.986
So, do you know of any jobs...

13:40.987 --> 13:43.404
that are both honest and well-paid?

13:44.458 --> 13:45.144
Holy crap!

13:45.641 --> 13:46.769
Honest and well-paid?

13:47.196 --> 13:49.279
These two never stick together.

13:50.289 --> 13:50.769
Yes.

13:51.088 --> 13:51.816
There is me.

13:52.612 --> 13:54.029
I'm honest and good-hearted.

13:54.071 --> 13:55.987
Good-hearted but no money.

14:03.654 --> 14:05.028
No offense but...

14:05.029 --> 14:07.195
my dad told me
to find a job that earns...

14:07.196 --> 14:07.946
an honest penny and also…

14:07.947 --> 14:09.237
If you want to take care of your dad...

14:10.239 --> 14:11.637
then get rid of your dignity first.

14:15.329 --> 14:16.933
Hung, do you remember?

14:17.362 --> 14:18.446
Brothers for life.

14:18.987 --> 14:20.071
We live and die together.

14:20.446 --> 14:21.487
I never forget that.

14:23.279 --> 14:25.071
Could you pretend to
take us out for some meals?

14:25.571 --> 14:26.446
Damn you asshole!

14:27.446 --> 14:28.112
I'mma beat you with this slipper…

14:28.113 --> 14:29.404
always thinking about food.

14:31.446 --> 14:32.112
Hung, let's go!

14:33.154 --> 14:33.904
What?

14:38.446 --> 14:39.446
- Fine.
- Let's go!

14:48.362 --> 14:49.487
Should we eat instant noodles tonight, Ba?

14:49.737 --> 14:51.862
Quit it. We'll be full of
noodle soup by then.

14:53.821 --> 14:55.946
Could you take us out
for dining like this again?

14:56.047 --> 14:57.505
Like, every day?

14:57.612 --> 14:59.029
I really respect you.

14:59.862 --> 15:00.529
My God!

15:00.987 --> 15:02.446
Sir, make me four bowls of noodle soup.

15:02.696 --> 15:03.904
- You got it.
- Just three bowls, sir.

15:04.237 --> 15:05.404
What? Four or three?

15:06.821 --> 15:07.654
Oh…you?

15:07.732 --> 15:08.761
Huh?

15:17.237 --> 15:18.112
Three bowls of noodle soup…

15:18.571 --> 15:19.112
then bailed.

15:22.153 --> 15:23.723
Sir, let me pay…

15:23.987 --> 15:24.637
Are you nuts?

15:24.662 --> 15:26.170
This is not the right time to be courteous.

15:26.487 --> 15:28.654
But clearly, we haven't paid him
three bowls of noodle soup.

15:29.237 --> 15:30.946
Put aside your dignity.

15:32.112 --> 15:33.657
It's my money, I'll do what I want.

15:33.987 --> 15:35.487
Sir, I'll pay for three bowls of
noodle soup the other day.

15:36.529 --> 15:37.696
It was 100.000 VND in total.

15:40.088 --> 15:42.422
Sir, let us eat first,
we'll talk about this later.

15:43.626 --> 15:44.977
Okay, three bowls?

15:45.602 --> 15:46.242
Yes.

15:48.862 --> 15:50.071
Just let me pay half of it first!

15:50.112 --> 15:50.821
Don't be silly!

15:50.904 --> 15:53.487
Stop it. I almost forgot the taste of meat!

15:56.368 --> 15:57.283
Look at him!

15:59.740 --> 16:01.448
Oh. What a coincidence!

16:11.208 --> 16:12.708
Too many things to handle that day...

16:13.112 --> 16:14.529
I couldn't treat you guys well.

16:15.221 --> 16:15.888
It's on me today.

16:16.196 --> 16:16.821
Oh, you don't have to…

16:16.862 --> 16:17.279
Sir!

16:17.487 --> 16:18.446
Make me three bowls of pork bone stew!

16:18.696 --> 16:19.237
Ok!

16:23.674 --> 16:24.383
So...

16:25.362 --> 16:27.362
have you considered my offer?

16:30.737 --> 16:31.737
If you join my gang...

16:32.029 --> 16:33.196
you won't have to
worry about meals anymore.

16:35.946 --> 16:37.821
Thank you, but we can still handle it.

16:38.946 --> 16:40.946
I don't ask you to kill or rob...

16:41.779 --> 16:43.321
just help us with some small errands.

16:43.821 --> 16:45.112
I can pay you well.

16:48.182 --> 16:48.868
Sir!

16:49.239 --> 16:50.547
Give me three more bowls of ham hocks!

16:50.862 --> 16:51.712
Ok!

16:53.279 --> 16:55.071
That's nice bro!

16:55.196 --> 16:56.196
Gotta appreciate his generosity...

16:56.197 --> 16:57.737
or we're gonna be punished in hell.

17:03.571 --> 17:04.321
Oh, here!

17:06.838 --> 17:07.463
Thanks.

17:12.476 --> 17:13.054
Okay.

17:25.266 --> 17:25.829
So?

17:26.755 --> 17:28.505
Have you eaten enough
to think more clearly?

17:31.091 --> 17:31.907
Thank you...

17:32.555 --> 17:33.971
but gangsters are not our things.

17:34.677 --> 17:35.618
Suit yourself.

17:38.779 --> 17:39.571
Check, please!

17:40.196 --> 17:40.696
Okay.

17:41.731 --> 17:42.540
Let me pay for this.

17:43.013 --> 17:43.649
It's on me.

17:44.689 --> 17:46.414
200.000 VND in total.

17:51.237 --> 17:52.737
You dropped the money… - Oh.

17:54.779 --> 17:56.487
It's a bit dirty now, would you take it?

17:56.571 --> 17:58.529
As long as it's real money.
A bit dirty is not an issue!

18:00.779 --> 18:03.904
Dirty money is still money.
Its value remains unchanged.

18:12.112 --> 18:13.821
The same with how others perceive you...

18:14.696 --> 18:16.237
doesn't affect your worth.

18:17.821 --> 18:19.237
Do all gangsters have
such a philosophic way of saying?

18:19.404 --> 18:20.112
No.

18:20.755 --> 18:22.696
I think he means we should be clean.

18:25.440 --> 18:27.016
If you need anything,
just find me at Cho Lon.

18:29.247 --> 18:29.781
Okay.

18:33.321 --> 18:35.737
We're full now.
Take us to get some jobs, would you?

18:35.987 --> 18:36.446
Yeah right.

18:38.779 --> 18:39.446
Ok, let's go!

18:39.904 --> 18:40.987
But it should be decent.

18:41.779 --> 18:42.362
Sure!

18:42.821 --> 18:43.946
And very okay!

19:06.237 --> 19:08.321
Do come in.

19:42.154 --> 19:44.112
How old are you, sweety?

19:44.446 --> 19:45.987
I…am 28…

19:46.446 --> 19:48.404
You're 12 years younger than me.

19:48.946 --> 19:49.625
What?

19:50.112 --> 19:51.362
You're so handsome, sweety.

19:51.571 --> 19:53.279
Thank you.

19:53.987 --> 19:54.821
Phong!

19:56.571 --> 19:57.180
Ba!

19:57.844 --> 19:58.844
Phong!

20:22.154 --> 20:23.487
Such a good decent job!

20:23.654 --> 20:24.237
Oh my!

20:26.279 --> 20:27.654
We should thank Hung for this.

20:27.821 --> 20:28.262
Ba!

20:28.414 --> 20:29.746
Should we give him a little commission?

20:32.737 --> 20:33.661
You're good, Ba?

20:35.529 --> 20:38.571
What happened today must be kept
as a secret until death.

20:39.112 --> 20:41.196
Whoever spills the bean,
especially for Ut Det...

20:41.654 --> 20:42.286
I'll kill him.

20:43.252 --> 20:43.988
Are you out of your mind?

20:44.239 --> 20:45.136
Who dares to reveal such private things?

20:48.362 --> 20:49.487
Ta Dinh Phong! The customers called you.

20:53.196 --> 20:54.029
Ok!

20:57.196 --> 20:58.362
Ba, go with him.

20:59.755 --> 21:00.473
Yes!

21:03.821 --> 21:05.362
Hey, Ba, wait a second.

21:07.946 --> 21:08.862
Could you go for me?

21:10.237 --> 21:11.112
The customers want you.

21:11.779 --> 21:12.362
Stay calm.

21:12.737 --> 21:13.497
Don't worry.

21:13.862 --> 21:14.737
Go make money to marry Ut Det.

21:18.305 --> 21:19.082
You got this!

21:21.112 --> 21:22.029
And you said we were best friends?

21:22.404 --> 21:23.536
Friends my ass!

21:34.237 --> 21:34.821
I'm sorry!

21:38.779 --> 21:40.154
Get out!

21:41.154 --> 21:43.279
Sir! Hey! Wrong room.

21:43.304 --> 21:45.013
Long!

21:45.112 --> 21:46.196
- Long!
- Wrong room.

21:46.471 --> 21:48.388
Oh no grandpa! Wrong room! Oh my god!

21:48.987 --> 21:50.904
Motherfucker, wrong room again!
Fuck you all!

21:51.279 --> 21:52.612
Do you have any cigarettes left?

21:52.637 --> 21:54.429
That's all we got. We must save.

21:54.643 --> 21:56.602
Saving what? We earned a bunch of cash.

21:57.737 --> 21:58.293
Here.

22:00.821 --> 22:01.446
Hey, Ba!

22:02.237 --> 22:02.779
Are you okay now?

22:03.779 --> 22:04.612
I can barely breathe.

22:05.125 --> 22:05.863
Why?

22:07.571 --> 22:09.029
Wow, you lucky dog.

22:10.529 --> 22:11.404
Stop teasing him!

22:12.779 --> 22:13.696
You guys don't know.

22:14.654 --> 22:15.862
She had smelly armpits!

22:15.987 --> 22:17.404
And she held me so tight
she wouldn't let me go!

22:17.654 --> 22:18.696
This is murder!

22:19.071 --> 22:21.736
Why didn't you let Phong handle that
and you sing with those ladies instead?

22:21.737 --> 22:22.487
Right.

22:22.612 --> 22:23.654
No, she's kinky.

22:23.862 --> 22:25.071
She has beard fetish, like me.

22:25.112 --> 22:26.154
You have no beard.

22:26.279 --> 22:27.112
Bullshit!

22:27.154 --> 22:27.987
Let's get something to eat!

22:31.423 --> 22:32.298
It's my treat!

22:34.737 --> 22:35.404
Ok!

22:35.946 --> 22:37.821
Long, I can barely breathe.

22:38.154 --> 22:38.987
Just take it slow.

22:42.716 --> 22:44.239
How are y'all doing recently?

22:44.740 --> 22:46.254
We can't fucking do anything!

22:46.471 --> 22:47.738
What was the problem?

22:48.481 --> 22:49.597
Since you moved here...

22:49.927 --> 22:51.059
they've been giving us shit!

22:51.958 --> 22:53.066
How about moving to another place?

22:54.071 --> 22:55.237
This place has been protected.

22:55.529 --> 22:57.737
There would be more trouble
if I moved to the other place.

22:58.487 --> 22:59.404
Sit here.

23:00.071 --> 23:01.196
I'll make you two bowls of noodle soup.

23:01.592 --> 23:02.466
We'll figure it out later.

23:09.071 --> 23:10.696
You all conspire with each other!

23:11.321 --> 23:12.043
Where's my money?

23:13.196 --> 23:13.987
What money?

23:16.737 --> 23:17.737
The money you robbed us!

23:26.987 --> 23:28.279
- What are you doing?
- You hid in there, didn't you?

23:28.321 --> 23:31.279
I didn't! I spent everything! Oh God!

23:32.112 --> 23:33.404
Where's my money?

23:35.737 --> 23:36.279
Where's the bag?

23:39.737 --> 23:40.654
Where are Ut Det's shorts?

23:41.112 --> 23:42.196
Where is it?

23:42.696 --> 23:43.904
I have no idea what you're talking about!

23:47.612 --> 23:48.821
I saw a rag cloth in the bike's glove box.

23:49.758 --> 23:51.004
Is that what he means?

23:57.821 --> 23:58.529
Where is it?

23:58.904 --> 23:59.653
Damn it, where's the money?

24:00.071 --> 24:01.529
- I told you it's gone!
- Gone what?

24:01.654 --> 24:02.071
Where's my money?

24:02.612 --> 24:03.279
Damn it!

24:08.904 --> 24:09.571
Damn!

24:09.612 --> 24:11.112
- Where's my money?
- How dare you turn it into rag cloth?

24:11.446 --> 24:12.487
Stop it!

24:13.696 --> 24:14.571
You're killing him!

24:15.821 --> 24:17.154
Look at Ut Det's shorts!

24:20.654 --> 24:22.404
How could they make it a rag cloth?

24:23.279 --> 24:23.862
Long?

24:24.404 --> 24:24.779
What?

24:25.112 --> 24:25.571
How is it?

24:25.737 --> 24:26.196
Is it enough?

24:27.279 --> 24:27.904
Almost.

24:28.164 --> 24:29.207
Maybe I'll make it next month.

24:31.737 --> 24:33.446
Are you dying in there?

24:36.737 --> 24:37.362
What are you doing?

24:38.154 --> 24:39.487
You're gonna break the door!

24:44.029 --> 24:44.529
Fuck!

24:45.362 --> 24:46.071
What the hell?

24:46.612 --> 24:47.779
Oh shit! I forgot.

24:47.946 --> 24:48.529
My goodness!

24:48.779 --> 24:50.872
Come inside with me if you can't wait.
Stop rushing me.

24:51.610 --> 24:52.778
I forgot the door was cracked.

24:53.946 --> 24:55.071
- Hey Phong!
- What?

24:55.237 --> 24:57.029
We must find another way
to earn money quickly...

24:57.237 --> 24:59.404
or Long's dad is gonna die
before we can make it.

25:02.501 --> 25:03.917
I think Hung's place is okay...

25:04.946 --> 25:05.529
just a bit...

25:09.760 --> 25:10.691
…weary.

25:11.826 --> 25:12.895
How about following him...

25:13.529 --> 25:14.571
to join the Cho Lon gang?

25:14.904 --> 25:15.762
It's faster that way.

25:16.481 --> 25:16.946
No.

25:17.263 --> 25:18.346
You know Long.

25:18.446 --> 25:19.340
There's no way he would follow.

25:19.654 --> 25:20.247
Oh God!

25:20.487 --> 25:22.696
It's easy. We're gonna implore him.

25:23.279 --> 25:25.821
I know he's really close to you.

25:29.487 --> 25:29.904
Your turn.

25:34.112 --> 25:35.279
The hell? You haven't flushed?

25:35.904 --> 25:36.612
Get used to it, dude!

25:37.446 --> 25:38.654
Did you use up all the toilet paper?

25:38.696 --> 25:39.770
Use your shirt instead.

25:40.349 --> 25:41.682
You are insane!

25:43.612 --> 25:45.237
Stop! Stop running!

25:51.112 --> 25:51.862
Stop right there!

26:23.154 --> 26:24.612
Long!

26:25.821 --> 26:26.446
Long!

26:38.696 --> 26:40.237
Long!

26:41.446 --> 26:42.071
Long!

27:02.321 --> 27:03.987
Hello. What is it, mom?

27:04.071 --> 27:04.987
Long?

27:05.404 --> 27:07.696
I've got something to tell you,
Phong's mom…

27:08.029 --> 27:08.571
What are you saying?

27:09.071 --> 27:12.279
…she's in debt
and being hunted down by gangsters.

27:13.237 --> 27:14.352
Give me a second, mom.

27:22.362 --> 27:25.029
Mom, calm down.
Tell me what happened to Phong's mom?

27:27.821 --> 27:28.362
Hey, Phong…

27:28.821 --> 27:29.487
It's me, Phong.

27:30.130 --> 27:30.880
What's wrong with my mom?

27:31.029 --> 27:33.321
Your mom is in debt to the mafia...

27:33.346 --> 27:35.096
they're hunting her down right now.

27:35.362 --> 27:38.112
She's hiding in my place.

27:38.446 --> 27:40.984
- Please do something.
- Alright.

27:43.612 --> 27:45.737
Phong, calm down.
I'll think of some way to solve this.

27:45.856 --> 27:48.187
They wanna kill my mom,
and you told me to calm down?

27:48.862 --> 27:50.071
You're gonna go home by what?

27:50.112 --> 27:50.779
I'll figure it out later.

27:50.904 --> 27:52.029
What are you going to do
when you come home?

27:52.057 --> 27:53.210
But I can't leave her alone there!

27:53.571 --> 27:54.601
Okay, go.

27:55.487 --> 27:56.046
Phong!

28:01.375 --> 28:02.132
I've got an idea.

28:10.279 --> 28:11.904
Have your friends replied?

28:15.310 --> 28:16.632
I know them well.

28:17.612 --> 28:18.737
They won't accept your offer.

28:23.071 --> 28:24.904
You pay too much attention
to details while playing chess.

28:29.029 --> 28:30.029
Damn you! I'm tired too!

28:30.112 --> 28:31.112
Fuck you bastard!

28:34.263 --> 28:36.567
I don't wanna lose a single piece...

28:37.987 --> 28:39.071
even the weakest.

28:45.279 --> 28:47.529
There are no weak pieces on a chessboard.

28:55.174 --> 28:55.918
Advisor.

29:03.541 --> 29:04.661
Even the Advisor...

29:05.821 --> 29:07.208
has its own value.

29:14.321 --> 29:15.340
Spare him!

29:16.154 --> 29:17.029
Bastard!

29:17.904 --> 29:18.821
I said spare him!

29:19.196 --> 29:20.112
If you didn't tell them...

29:20.113 --> 29:21.987
how could they know
where Big Brother hid?

29:24.612 --> 29:25.279
Take him out!

29:28.987 --> 29:31.112
Damn! Why did you stop me?

29:31.696 --> 29:33.612
He won't say if we don't
beat the hell out of him.

29:35.237 --> 29:35.862
I tell you this...

29:37.154 --> 29:39.987
protecting Big Brother
is everyone's responsibility...

29:40.279 --> 29:41.696
not your own.

29:43.279 --> 29:44.154
Why did you keep it from us?

29:47.196 --> 29:47.946
Why did you keep it from us?

30:13.362 --> 30:14.362
Why do you guys come here?

30:16.821 --> 30:17.904
We wanna join the Cho Lon gang.

30:18.696 --> 30:19.487
Are you out of your mind?

30:21.487 --> 30:22.112
Hien...

30:25.821 --> 30:27.946
Is your offer still valid?

30:29.338 --> 30:31.255
The door is always open for you.

30:34.071 --> 30:36.362
But first, we need your help on one thing.

30:39.487 --> 30:39.987
Say it.

30:41.404 --> 30:42.446
We need 50 million VND.

30:43.862 --> 30:44.362
Immediately.

30:44.924 --> 30:45.777
Hey kiddo...

30:47.297 --> 30:48.797
do you think this is a bank or what?

30:49.446 --> 30:50.487
On-demand all the time?

30:51.112 --> 30:51.571
Fine.

30:55.649 --> 30:57.107
But I also have one condition.
